Korasi:
Muchinjikwa, muchinjikwa, ndicho chidzo changu;
Kusvikira ndawana zororo kudenga.

1. Mwari muri zuva redu, munovheneka nzira yedu;
Murudo rwenyu rukuru, tinowana zororo chairo.

2. Chengetai vana venyu, vanofamba murima;
Vhenekai mweya yedu, tizive chokwadi chenyu.

3. Makakomborera Africa, makatipa nyika ino;
Ngaikudzwe zita renyu, kubva zvino kusvikira narini. Amen.

1. Ishe komborera Africa,
